## Why This Is Asked
This question probes OTCA data governance, privacy, and real-time moderation across tenants, focusing on edge processing, per-tenant residency, and end-to-end auditability.

## Key Concepts
- OTCA cross-tenant data flows
- Privacy budgets and differential privacy
- Edge processing and regional streaming (Kafka)
- Immutable audit logs and rollback
- Drift and false-positive testing

## Code Example
